  "text": "{\\pos(1050,253)}Infoboxes\\NBernieCrane"
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,383)}Formatting\\NSewil\\NDatenshi"
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,493)}Edit-checking\\NGalaxy 9000"
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Until I can reach the sky,"
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I believe, until the next tomorrow, hey"
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Chasing and being chased on top of Mobius' ring."
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Getting closer and facing forward, hey I want to share your style."
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It begins, it expands, this flavor that exceeds imagination"
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I feel so good throughout my body, I will become free, oh yeah"
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the music, even if it's far."
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the one dream, by telling each other."
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the good times and laugh."
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll keep going until I can reach the sky."
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's overcome it now, I believe in the next tomorrow yeah yeah..."
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You were waiting there on the other side of the invisible wall."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll be there soon, I believe in one world yeah yeah..."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "style": "Title",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1800,900)}I Couldn't Save Them!!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "I'd heard some rumors that you were on this island..."
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "So, that was true?"
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Seeing how you helped out these brats,"
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "that must mean you're still a pirate, at your age..."
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Rayleigh-san?"
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "If you people would withdraw my bounty..."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "I'd be able to retire in peace, too."
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "The pirates' sins won't disappear, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Especially not those of the Roger Pirates."
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "But if we were to try and catch you,"
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "it would require a bit more dedication than we have right now."
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "What a relief, Zoro! This old man really is amazing!"
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "The body I could not pierce no matter how many times I stabbed him..."
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "He just stopped him! How?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "You can't let them leave, can you, Kizaru-kun?"
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Give me a break, here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "If we can't catch these kids..."
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Then we at Navy HQ wouldn't be able to face the Celestial Dragons in Mariejoa."
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Would you please get out of my way?"
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Usopp! Brook!"
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Take Zoro and run!"
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Let's go, Brook!"
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Everyone, only think of how to escape!"
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Right now..."
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "We can't..."
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Beat these guys!"
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Oh, great. That's really annoying."
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Nami",
  "text": "Franky!"
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "I'm gonna use all my cola energy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "This'll be my last attack!"
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Coup de Vent!"
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "That damned idiot must have felt that!"
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "Run!"
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Pops, thank you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "No problem! I'll pray for your safety!"
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Mirror of Yata"
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "It's bright!"
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "Light! He's doing something!"
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "I won't let you pass!"
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "It's been a long time since I used my sword."
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Sword of the Gathering Clouds of Heaven"
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "I'm in trouble here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "I was expecting things to be easy when I came to this island..."
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "Worries are also a part of life, Kizaru-kun."
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "The light ahead of us disappeared."
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Seems like the old man saved us again."
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "T-T-That was scary!"
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "Seems like he's the real Dark King."
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "This is the first time I've seen anyone stop the old guy."
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "But we're just one step away from catching Roronoa with his bounty of over 100 million..."
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "PX-1! Roronoa is half-dead!"
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "Go take him out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sanji",
  "text": "He's..."
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sanji",
  "text": "Franky!"
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sanji",
  "text": "Take care of Nami-san! Please go on without me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "Be careful! We'll be alright!"
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Nami",
  "text": "Sanji-kun?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sanji",
  "text": "He's going after Usopp and the others!"
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Zoro",
  "text": "Put me down..."
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Zoro",
  "text": "I'll let you escape..."
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Don't be ridiculous! You're even more useless than I am right now!"
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "We're running together!"
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "That's what Luffy wanted us to do!"
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "Could it be...?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "He's here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "Usopp-san!"
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "Usopp-san, go on ahead!"
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Stop it, Brook!"
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "You know how strong he is, don't you?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "Hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "All for one, one for all!"
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "There are times when a man has no choice but to act!"
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Brook",
  "text": "A bone-crushing defeat..."
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Brook!"
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Don't come here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sanji",
  "text": "Stop right there, you damn bastard!"
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Sanji!"
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sanji",
  "text": "My leg...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Run, Sanji!"
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "He's aiming for you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sanji",
  "text": "Idiot! Hurry up and go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "As you can see, my subordinates are more than strong enough."
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Zoro, I'm sorry! I dropped you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Are you alright?"
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "They're in trouble over there!"
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "I won't even need my broadaxe, will I?"
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "I thought I told you, you don't have time to worry about your friends!"
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Leg Locked, Heave-Ho!"
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Chopper",
  "text": "Luffy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Chopper",
  "text": "How can that guy's attacks hurt a rubber man like Luffy?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Chopper",
  "text": "Damn!"
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Robin",
  "text": "Chopper! Don't stop!"
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Sanji!"
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Sanji!"
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Chopper",
  "text": "Damn it! They'll all be killed!"
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Robin",
  "text": "Don't do it, Chopper!"
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Choopper",
  "text": "Stop it, you people!"
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Chopper",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Rumble"
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Nami",
  "text": "Chopper!"
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "That's the thing from back then!"
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "What's this?"
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Robin",
  "text": "I had heard of this..."
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "That's an interesting power, but..."
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "It seems like you've lost your common sense, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Robin",
  "text": "Luffy, watch out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "That Chopper... He did that again?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "I don't know why, but he seems to be distracted by him..."
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Now's our chance!"
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Sanji, Brook! Get up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Let's hurry up and get away from here while we have the chance!"
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "He's gonna fire another beam!"
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Hey, hurry and wake up, Brook!"
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Sanji!"
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kuma",
  "text": "Wait, PX-1."
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Another one showed up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "What's going on?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "No way!"
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "How many of these guys are there, anyway?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Zoro",
  "text": "This guy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Zoro",
  "text": "...He's the real one!"
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kuma",
  "text": "So, you survived, Roronoa?"
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Zoro",
  "text": "Thanks to your mercy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "H... Hey, Zoro..."
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "This is no time to be talking..."
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kuma",
  "text": "If you were to go on a vacation, where would you like to go?"
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Hey, Zoro!"
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "If you don't hurry up and run..."
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Z-Zoro..."
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "Damn you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "What did you do to Zoro?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "He was..."
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "He was just..."
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Usopp",
  "text": "...Right here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Zoro...?"
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Z-Zoro?"
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Zoro?"
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Zoro!"
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Zoro!!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Robin",
  "text": "Stop it, Chopper!"
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Robin",
  "text": "Don't be reckless!"
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Luffy",
  "text": "Zoro... Where did you go?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "He doesn't have any self-control..."
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "Regardless, that Kuma boy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Sentoumaru",
  "text": "What is that bastard doing here?"
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "Bartholomew Kuma..."
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Kizaru",
  "text": "This is why you can't trust pirates!"
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Rayleigh",
  "text": "They're surrounded over there, too?"
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "Zoro just vanished!"
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "Franky",
  "text": "Does this mean that the real one showed up at last?"
